  "details": "This is more of a question instead of a bug.  So I play on oculus rift,   And I link my VR chat account with my steam account.  So if I were to play VR chat from my Oculus app instead of opening steam on my hour still count. I’m asking due to the fact that there’s a ranking system inside VR chat As of right now I’m a “New User” and I feel like I’ve been playing long enough to be at least a “User”  so my overall question is  Will I still be able to rank up? If the game isn’t played through steam?",
